    },
    "16": {
      "text": "<C:0001,0004,>Estão a ver, quando aparece a palavra <C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Excelente\n<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF>ao executarem um ataque perfeito com um salto?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0001,0004,>Estão a ver, quando aparece a palavra <C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Excelente\n<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF>ao executarem um ataque perfeito com um salto?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
