      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0001,0004,>Estão a ver, quando aparece a palavra <C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Excelente\n<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF>ao executarem um ataque perfeito com um salto?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "17": {
      "text": "<C:0001,0004,>Então, todos os danos que infligires deverão\nresultar de golpes <C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Excelentes<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0000,0003,000000FF>!<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
