      "original_text": "<C:0001,0004,>Então, todos os danos que infligires deverão\nresultar de golpes <C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Excelentes<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0000,0003,000000FF>!<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
